{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Business Empire \u2013 Strategic Trade and Investment Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Business Empire is a multiplayer board game where players build a business empire by strategically acquiring and developing properties. Up to 6 players can join this dynamic game, purchasing properties, upgrading them, and aiming to buy out their opponents to take control. The ultimate goal is to acquire all rival properties and win the game.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free Property Selection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595430/extras/Build.gif?t=1743704328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike traditional dice-based mechanics, players can freely choose properties based on their strategy.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Development System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595430/extras/Upgrade.gif?t=1743704328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchased properties can be upgraded to increase their value and generate higher profits.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Chance Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595430/extras/chancecard.gif?t=1743704328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At certain turns, random chance cards appear, providing players with advantages or unexpected disadvantages.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Competitive Multiplayer Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595430/extras/buyACard.gif?t=1743704328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players compete against each other in a strategic decision-making process.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Busin